From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_hnat: harden gateway nexthop, USBHNAT, and
 DSA 802.1Q offload

Track routed gateway nexthop invalidation, preserve USBHNAT extdev mapping across bind, and support multi-DSA 802.1Q offload paths.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
